{"ghsa_id":"GHSA-qmc9-vqq2-8mv3","cve_id":"CVE-2026-45752","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OISF/suricata/security-advisories/GHSA-qmc9-vqq2-8mv3","html_url":"https://github.com/OISF/suricata/security/advisories/GHSA-qmc9-vqq2-8mv3","summary":"detect/transform: use-after-free in decompress transforms","description":"### Impact\r\n\r\nWhen certain detection transforms are chained, the decompress transform pipeline could read from an inspection buffer after it had been reallocated and freed.\r\n\r\nThe issue is reached during network traffic processing, but requires a malicious rule as Suricata will crash whatever the traffic.\r\n\r\n### Patches\r\n\r\nUpgrade to Suricata 8.0.5.\r\n\r\n### Workarounds\r\n\r\nAvoid rules that chain `gunzip` or `zlib_deflate` with `max-size` bigger than 4096 after another transform\r\n\r\n### References\r\n\r\nhttps://redmine.openinfosecfoundation.org/issues/8536\r\n\r\n### Credits\r\n\r\nTrail of Bits, in collaboration with Anthropic.\r\n","severity":"medium","author":null,"publisher":{"login":"jasonish","id":644115,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NDExNQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/644115?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonish","html_url":"https://github.com/jasonish","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonish/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonish/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonish/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonish/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonish/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonish/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonish/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonish/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonish/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"identifiers":[{"value":"GHSA-qmc9-vqq2-8mv3","type":"GHSA"},{"value":"CVE-2026-45752","type":"CVE"}],"state":"published","created_at":null,"updated_at":"2026-06-02T20:38:01Z","published_at":"2026-06-02T20:38:01Z","closed_at":null,"withdrawn_at":null,"submission":null,"vulnerabilities":[{"package":{"ecosystem":"other","name":"suricata"},"vulnerable_version_range":">= 8.0.0, < 8.0.5","patched_versions":"8.0.5","vulnerable_functions":[]}],"cvss_severities":{"cvss_v3":{"vector_string":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:H/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H","score":5.9},"cvss_v4":{"vector_string":null,"score":null}},"cwes":[{"cwe_id":"CWE-416","name":"Use After Free"}],"cwe_ids":["CWE-416"],"credits":[],"credits_detailed":[],"collaborating_users":null,"collaborating_teams":null,"private_fork":null,"comments":1,"cvss":{"vector_string":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:H/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H","score":5.9}}